    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176750/extras/5045552c4218fcd8ca212889b4eddb78.avif?t=1738899936\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><strong>Let's Play Cards: Baccarat is a thrilling and exciting card game that is perfect for players who love strategy and luck. </strong><br><br>The game is played with two hands, the player and the banker, with the objective of having the highest hand value possible. Your mission is to play Baccarat as good as possible!<br><br>In Let's Play Cards: Baccarat, players can choose to play as one of four different heroes.<br><br>In addition, the game includes a helpful hint system that can guide players through difficult decisions and help them make the best possible moves.<br><br>With its immersive graphics, exciting gameplay, and easy-to-use controls, Let's Play Cards: Baccarat is the perfect game for players who love the thrill of competition and the excitement of high-stakes card games. So come on in, choose your hero, and let's play some Baccarat!<br><br><strong>Main Game Features:<br>- 4 unique heroes<br>- Intuitive and easy-to-use interface<br>- Hint button</strong>",
